{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)","titleHtml":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types","section":"","kind":"index","summary":"See also type system overview and fundamental types defined by the language.","html":"<p>See also <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/type\">type system overview</a> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/types\">fundamental types defined by the language</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Additional_basic_types_and_macros\">Additional basic types and macros</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstddef\">&lt;cstddef&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size_t</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  unsigned integer type returned by the <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/sizeof\"><code>sizeof</code></a> operator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/ptrdiff_t\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ptrdiff_t</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  signed integer type returned when subtracting two pointers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/nullptr_t\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>nullptr_t</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  the type of the null pointer literal <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/nullptr\"><code>nullptr</code></a> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/NULL\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>NULL</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  implement